<text><![CDATA[Neptune is the eighth planet from the Sun.]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[By mass, it is the third largest planet in the solar system.]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[Neptune was first seen in 1846 from an observatory in Berlin.]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Length of day:</B><br>16 hours 7 minutes]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Length of year:</B> 165 Earth years]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Diameter:</B> 49,528 km]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Surface temperature:</B> –210&#176;C]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Distance from Earth:</B> 4.4 billion km]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Distance from Sun:</B> 4.5 billion km]]></text>



